{
  "success": true,
  "credits_remaining": 22193,
  "credits_charged": 1,
  "type": "video",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EPechcSwE0",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "text": "Today, we bring you a compelling speech",
      "startMs": "1040",
      "endMs": "6560",
      "startTimeText": "0:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "by Sneha Dubey, India's first secretary",
      "startMs": "3320",
      "endMs": "9080",
      "startTimeText": "0:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "at the United Nations. In this powerful",
      "startMs": "6560",
      "endMs": "11120",
      "startTimeText": "0:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "address, she responds to Pakistan's",
      "startMs": "9080",
      "endMs": "13720",
      "startTimeText": "0:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "accusations at the UN General Assembly,",
      "startMs": "11120",
      "endMs": "15520",
      "startTimeText": "0:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "calling out its history of supporting",
      "startMs": "13720",
      "endMs": "17600",
      "startTimeText": "0:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "terrorism and emphasizing India's",
      "startMs": "15520",
      "endMs": "19560",
      "startTimeText": "0:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "democratic values.",
      "startMs": "17600",
      "endMs": "21680",
      "startTimeText": "0:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "She also expresses India's support for",
      "startMs": "19560",
      "endMs": "24040",
      "startTimeText": "0:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "lifting economic embargoes that harm",
      "startMs": "21680",
      "endMs": "25880",
      "startTimeText": "0:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "developing nations.",
      "startMs": "24040",
      "endMs": "28440",
      "startTimeText": "0:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch this speech with English subtitles",
      "startMs": "25880",
      "endMs": "30000",
      "startTimeText": "0:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "and learn from her eloquence and",
      "startMs": "28440",
      "endMs": "33240",
      "startTimeText": "0:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "diplomatic prowess.",
      "startMs": "30000",
      "endMs": "33240",
      "startTimeText": "0:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dear colleagues, excellencies, before we",
      "startMs": "33800",
      "endMs": "38000",
      "startTimeText": "0:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "conclude this session of the general the",
      "startMs": "35680",
      "endMs": "40400",
      "startTimeText": "0:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "general debate, I would like to tell you",
      "startMs": "38000",
      "endMs": "42600",
      "startTimeText": "0:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "that one delegation has requested to",
      "startMs": "40400",
      "endMs": "44840",
      "startTimeText": "0:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "exercise the right of reply. I would",
      "startMs": "42600",
      "endMs": "46920",
      "startTimeText": "0:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "like to remind members that statements",
      "startMs": "44840",
      "endMs": "50400",
      "startTimeText": "0:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "made in exercise of the right of reply",
      "startMs": "46920",
      "endMs": "53160",
      "startTimeText": "0:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "are limited to 10 minutes for the first",
      "startMs": "50400",
      "endMs": "56360",
      "startTimeText": "0:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "intervention and 5 minutes for the",
      "startMs": "53160",
      "endMs": "58840",
      "startTimeText": "0:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "second intervention.",
      "startMs": "56360",
      "endMs": "61600",
      "startTimeText": "0:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "And that delegations must take the floor",
      "startMs": "58840",
      "endMs": "63840",
      "startTimeText": "0:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "from their seats.",
      "startMs": "61600",
      "endMs": "66040",
      "startTimeText": "1:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "I now give the floor",
      "startMs": "63840",
      "endMs": "70440",
      "startTimeText": "1:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "to the representative of India.",
      "startMs": "66040",
      "endMs": "70440",
      "startTimeText": "1:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "77480",
      "endMs": "82560",
      "startTimeText": "1:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "we exercise our right of reply to one",
      "startMs": "79280",
      "endMs": "85480",
      "startTimeText": "1:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "more attempt by the leader of Pakistan",
      "startMs": "82560",
      "endMs": "87960",
      "startTimeText": "1:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "to tarnish the image of this august",
      "startMs": "85480",
      "endMs": "89160",
      "startTimeText": "1:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "forum",
      "startMs": "87960",
      "endMs": "91280",
      "startTimeText": "1:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "by bringing in matters internal to my",
      "startMs": "89160",
      "endMs": "94640",
      "startTimeText": "1:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "country and going so far as to spew",
      "startMs": "91280",
      "endMs": "98240",
      "startTimeText": "1:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "falsehoods on the world stage.",
      "startMs": "94640",
      "endMs": "100520",
      "startTimeText": "1:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "While such statements deserve our",
      "startMs": "98240",
      "endMs": "103320",
      "startTimeText": "1:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "collective contempt and sympathy for the",
      "startMs": "100520",
      "endMs": "105280",
      "startTimeText": "1:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "mindset of the person who utters",
      "startMs": "103320",
      "endMs": "107640",
      "startTimeText": "1:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "falsehood repeatedly,",
      "startMs": "105280",
      "endMs": "110280",
      "startTimeText": "1:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "I am taking the floor to set the record",
      "startMs": "107640",
      "endMs": "112000",
      "startTimeText": "1:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "straight.",
      "startMs": "110280",
      "endMs": "113560",
      "startTimeText": "1:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regrettably,",
      "startMs": "112000",
      "endMs": "115840",
      "startTimeText": "1:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "this is not the first time the leader of",
      "startMs": "113560",
      "endMs": "118560",
      "startTimeText": "1:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pakistan has misused platforms provided",
      "startMs": "115840",
      "endMs": "121120",
      "startTimeText": "1:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "by the UN to propagate false and",
      "startMs": "118560",
      "endMs": "124440",
      "startTimeText": "1:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "malicious propaganda against my country.",
      "startMs": "121120",
      "endMs": "126920",
      "startTimeText": "2:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "And seeking in vain to divert the",
      "startMs": "124440",
      "endMs": "129640",
      "startTimeText": "2:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "world's attention from the sad state of",
      "startMs": "126920",
      "endMs": "132640",
      "startTimeText": "2:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "his country where terrorists enjoy free",
      "startMs": "129640",
      "endMs": "133720",
      "startTimeText": "2:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "pass",
      "startMs": "132640",
      "endMs": "136000",
      "startTimeText": "2:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "while the lives of ordinary people,",
      "startMs": "133720",
      "endMs": "137800",
      "startTimeText": "2:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "especially those belonging to the",
      "startMs": "136000",
      "endMs": "140520",
      "startTimeText": "2:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "minority communities, are turned upside",
      "startMs": "137800",
      "endMs": "142360",
      "startTimeText": "2:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "down.",
      "startMs": "140520",
      "endMs": "143920",
      "startTimeText": "2:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "142360",
      "endMs": "147200",
      "startTimeText": "2:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "member states are aware that Pakistan",
      "startMs": "143920",
      "endMs": "150320",
      "startTimeText": "2:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "has an established history and policy of",
      "startMs": "147200",
      "endMs": "153000",
      "startTimeText": "2:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "harboring, aiding, and actively",
      "startMs": "150320",
      "endMs": "154240",
      "startTimeText": "2:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "supporting",
      "startMs": "153000",
      "endMs": "156080",
      "startTimeText": "2:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "terrorists.",
      "startMs": "154240",
      "endMs": "158040",
      "startTimeText": "2:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a country which has been",
      "startMs": "156080",
      "endMs": "160680",
      "startTimeText": "2:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "globally recognized as one openly",
      "startMs": "158040",
      "endMs": "164000",
      "startTimeText": "2:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "supporting, training, financing,",
      "startMs": "160680",
      "endMs": "166600",
      "startTimeText": "2:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "and arming terrorists as a matter of",
      "startMs": "164000",
      "endMs": "168840",
      "startTimeText": "2:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "state policy.",
      "startMs": "166600",
      "endMs": "171160",
      "startTimeText": "2:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "It holds the ignoble record",
      "startMs": "168840",
      "endMs": "172680",
      "startTimeText": "2:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "of hosting the largest number of",
      "startMs": "171160",
      "endMs": "175600",
      "startTimeText": "2:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "terrorist proscribed by the UN Security",
      "startMs": "172680",
      "endMs": "177920",
      "startTimeText": "2:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "Council.",
      "startMs": "175600",
      "endMs": "179600",
      "startTimeText": "2:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "177920",
      "endMs": "181400",
      "startTimeText": "2:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "we marked the solemn occasion of the",
      "startMs": "179600",
      "endMs": "184040",
      "startTimeText": "2:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "20th anniversary of the 9/11 terror",
      "startMs": "181400",
      "endMs": "186680",
      "startTimeText": "3:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "attacks just a few days back.",
      "startMs": "184040",
      "endMs": "188880",
      "startTimeText": "3:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "The world has not forgotten",
      "startMs": "186680",
      "endMs": "190760",
      "startTimeText": "3:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "that the mastermind behind that",
      "startMs": "188880",
      "endMs": "193760",
      "startTimeText": "3:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "dastardly event, Osama bin Laden, got",
      "startMs": "190760",
      "endMs": "196040",
      "startTimeText": "3:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "shelter in Pakistan.",
      "startMs": "193760",
      "endMs": "198480",
      "startTimeText": "3:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pakistan leadership continues to glorify",
      "startMs": "196040",
      "endMs": "200920",
      "startTimeText": "3:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "him as a martyr.",
      "startMs": "198480",
      "endMs": "203600",
      "startTimeText": "3:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regrettably, even today, we heard the",
      "startMs": "200920",
      "endMs": "206560",
      "startTimeText": "3:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "leader of Pakistan trying to justify",
      "startMs": "203600",
      "endMs": "208239",
      "startTimeText": "3:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "acts of terror.",
      "startMs": "206560",
      "endMs": "210400",
      "startTimeText": "3:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "Such defense of terrorism is",
      "startMs": "208239",
      "endMs": "213800",
      "startTimeText": "3:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "unacceptable in the modern world.",
      "startMs": "210400",
      "endMs": "216720",
      "startTimeText": "3:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "We keep hearing that Pakistan is a",
      "startMs": "213800",
      "endMs": "218959",
      "startTimeText": "3:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "victim of terrorism.",
      "startMs": "216720",
      "endMs": "222160",
      "startTimeText": "3:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the country which is an arsonist",
      "startMs": "218959",
      "endMs": "225680",
      "startTimeText": "3:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "disguising itself as a firefighter.",
      "startMs": "222160",
      "endMs": "228080",
      "startTimeText": "3:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pakistan nurtures terrorists",
      "startMs": "225680",
      "endMs": "230200",
      "startTimeText": "3:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "in their backyard in the hope that they",
      "startMs": "228080",
      "endMs": "232560",
      "startTimeText": "3:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "will only harm their neighbors.",
      "startMs": "230200",
      "endMs": "233920",
      "startTimeText": "3:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our region,",
      "startMs": "232560",
      "endMs": "236680",
      "startTimeText": "3:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "in fact, the entire world has suffered",
      "startMs": "233920",
      "endMs": "238600",
      "startTimeText": "3:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "because of their policies.",
      "startMs": "236680",
      "endMs": "240640",
      "startTimeText": "3:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the other hand,",
      "startMs": "238600",
      "endMs": "242600",
      "startTimeText": "3:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "they are trying to cover up sectarian",
      "startMs": "240640",
      "endMs": "244720",
      "startTimeText": "4:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "violence in their country as acts of",
      "startMs": "242600",
      "endMs": "247160",
      "startTimeText": "4:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "terror.",
      "startMs": "244720",
      "endMs": "249080",
      "startTimeText": "4:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "247160",
      "endMs": "251200",
      "startTimeText": "4:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "this is also the country that still",
      "startMs": "249080",
      "endMs": "253760",
      "startTimeText": "4:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "holds the despicable record in our",
      "startMs": "251200",
      "endMs": "256560",
      "startTimeText": "4:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "region of having executed a religious",
      "startMs": "253760",
      "endMs": "258880",
      "startTimeText": "4:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "and cultural genocide against the people",
      "startMs": "256560",
      "endMs": "260920",
      "startTimeText": "4:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "of what is now Bangladesh.",
      "startMs": "258880",
      "endMs": "263280",
      "startTimeText": "4:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "As we mark the 50th anniversary this",
      "startMs": "260920",
      "endMs": "266120",
      "startTimeText": "4:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "year of that horrid event in history,",
      "startMs": "263280",
      "endMs": "268200",
      "startTimeText": "4:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "there is not even an acknowledgement,",
      "startMs": "266120",
      "endMs": "270680",
      "startTimeText": "4:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "much less accountability.",
      "startMs": "268200",
      "endMs": "273400",
      "startTimeText": "4:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, the minorities of Pakistan, the",
      "startMs": "270680",
      "endMs": "275760",
      "startTimeText": "4:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sikhs, the Hindus, the Christians, live",
      "startMs": "273400",
      "endMs": "278280",
      "startTimeText": "4:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "in constant fear and state-sponsored",
      "startMs": "275760",
      "endMs": "281360",
      "startTimeText": "4:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "suppression of their rights.",
      "startMs": "278280",
      "endMs": "284560",
      "startTimeText": "4:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a regime where anti-Semitism is",
      "startMs": "281360",
      "endMs": "287160",
      "startTimeText": "4:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "normalized by its leadership and even",
      "startMs": "284560",
      "endMs": "289560",
      "startTimeText": "4:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "justified.",
      "startMs": "287160",
      "endMs": "292760",
      "startTimeText": "4:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissenting voices are muzzled daily and",
      "startMs": "289560",
      "endMs": "295080",
      "startTimeText": "4:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "enforced disappearances and",
      "startMs": "292760",
      "endMs": "297400",
      "startTimeText": "4:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "extrajudicial killings are well",
      "startMs": "295080",
      "endMs": "299600",
      "startTimeText": "4:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "documented.",
      "startMs": "297400",
      "endMs": "301360",
      "startTimeText": "4:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "299600",
      "endMs": "304360",
      "startTimeText": "4:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "unlike Pakistan, India is a pluralistic",
      "startMs": "301360",
      "endMs": "307200",
      "startTimeText": "5:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "democracy with a substantial population",
      "startMs": "304360",
      "endMs": "309680",
      "startTimeText": "5:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "of minorities who have gone on to hold",
      "startMs": "307200",
      "endMs": "312240",
      "startTimeText": "5:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "highest offices in the country,",
      "startMs": "309680",
      "endMs": "315640",
      "startTimeText": "5:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "including as president, prime minister,",
      "startMs": "312240",
      "endMs": "318080",
      "startTimeText": "5:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "chief justices, and chiefs of army",
      "startMs": "315640",
      "endMs": "320080",
      "startTimeText": "5:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "staff.",
      "startMs": "318080",
      "endMs": "322840",
      "startTimeText": "5:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "India is also a country with a free",
      "startMs": "320080",
      "endMs": "325520",
      "startTimeText": "5:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "media and an independent judiciary that",
      "startMs": "322840",
      "endMs": "327560",
      "startTimeText": "5:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "keeps a watch and protects our",
      "startMs": "325520",
      "endMs": "330200",
      "startTimeText": "5:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "constitution.",
      "startMs": "327560",
      "endMs": "332960",
      "startTimeText": "5:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pluralism is a concept which is very",
      "startMs": "330200",
      "endMs": "335360",
      "startTimeText": "5:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "difficult to understand for Pakistan,",
      "startMs": "332960",
      "endMs": "337360",
      "startTimeText": "5:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "which constitutionally prohibits its",
      "startMs": "335360",
      "endMs": "339840",
      "startTimeText": "5:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "minorities from aspiring for high",
      "startMs": "337360",
      "endMs": "342280",
      "startTimeText": "5:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "offices of the state.",
      "startMs": "339840",
      "endMs": "344880",
      "startTimeText": "5:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "The least they could do is introspect",
      "startMs": "342280",
      "endMs": "347000",
      "startTimeText": "5:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "before exposing themselves to ridicule",
      "startMs": "344880",
      "endMs": "349240",
      "startTimeText": "5:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "on the world's stage.",
      "startMs": "347000",
      "endMs": "351160",
      "startTimeText": "5:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally, Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "349240",
      "endMs": "353600",
      "startTimeText": "5:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "let me reiterate here that the entire",
      "startMs": "351160",
      "endMs": "355840",
      "startTimeText": "5:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "union territories of Jammu and Kashmir",
      "startMs": "353600",
      "endMs": "359280",
      "startTimeText": "5:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "and Ladakh were, are, and will always be",
      "startMs": "355840",
      "endMs": "361720",
      "startTimeText": "5:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "an integral and inalienable part of",
      "startMs": "359280",
      "endMs": "363240",
      "startTimeText": "5:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "India.",
      "startMs": "361720",
      "endMs": "365200",
      "startTimeText": "6:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "This includes the areas that are under",
      "startMs": "363240",
      "endMs": "368720",
      "startTimeText": "6:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "the illegal occupation of Pakistan.",
      "startMs": "365200",
      "endMs": "370720",
      "startTimeText": "6:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "We call upon Pakistan to immediately",
      "startMs": "368720",
      "endMs": "373440",
      "startTimeText": "6:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "vacate all areas under its illegal",
      "startMs": "370720",
      "endMs": "376160",
      "startTimeText": "6:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "occupation.",
      "startMs": "373440",
      "endMs": "377919",
      "startTimeText": "6:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "376160",
      "endMs": "380200",
      "startTimeText": "6:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "allow me to be categorical about India's",
      "startMs": "377919",
      "endMs": "381440",
      "startTimeText": "6:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "position.",
      "startMs": "380200",
      "endMs": "383720",
      "startTimeText": "6:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "We desire normal relations with all our",
      "startMs": "381440",
      "endMs": "386360",
      "startTimeText": "6:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "neighbors, including Pakistan.",
      "startMs": "383720",
      "endMs": "389280",
      "startTimeText": "6:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "However, it is for Pakistan to work",
      "startMs": "386360",
      "endMs": "391400",
      "startTimeText": "6:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "sincerely towards creating a conducive",
      "startMs": "389280",
      "endMs": "393880",
      "startTimeText": "6:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "atmosphere, including by taking",
      "startMs": "391400",
      "endMs": "395320",
      "startTimeText": "6:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "credible,",
      "startMs": "393880",
      "endMs": "398560",
      "startTimeText": "6:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "verifiable, and irreversible actions to",
      "startMs": "395320",
      "endMs": "400840",
      "startTimeText": "6:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "not allow any territory under its",
      "startMs": "398560",
      "endMs": "402960",
      "startTimeText": "6:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "control to be used for cross-border",
      "startMs": "400840",
      "endMs": "406440",
      "startTimeText": "6:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "terrorism against India in any manner.",
      "startMs": "402960",
      "endMs": "409040",
      "startTimeText": "6:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "I thank you, Mr. President.",
      "startMs": "406440",
      "endMs": "410600",
      "startTimeText": "6:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "409040",
      "endMs": "413240",
      "startTimeText": "6:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "every year this assembly has rejected",
      "startMs": "410600",
      "endMs": "415800",
      "startTimeText": "6:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "the imposition of laws and regulations",
      "startMs": "413240",
      "endMs": "418560",
      "startTimeText": "6:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "with extraterritorial impact and all",
      "startMs": "415800",
      "endMs": "420160",
      "startTimeText": "6:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "other forms of coercive economic",
      "startMs": "418560",
      "endMs": "421320",
      "startTimeText": "6:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "measures",
      "startMs": "420160",
      "endMs": "423919",
      "startTimeText": "7:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "that hurt the progress and prosperity of",
      "startMs": "421320",
      "endMs": "426480",
      "startTimeText": "7:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "the people the world over.",
      "startMs": "423919",
      "endMs": "429800",
      "startTimeText": "7:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "Last year, 187 member states voted in",
      "startMs": "426480",
      "endMs": "433080",
      "startTimeText": "7:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "favor of resolution 78 stroke 7,",
      "startMs": "429800",
      "endMs": "435240",
      "startTimeText": "7:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "expressing their strong support to",
      "startMs": "433080",
      "endMs": "437560",
      "startTimeText": "7:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "lifting of the embargo.",
      "startMs": "435240",
      "endMs": "439760",
      "startTimeText": "7:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "The General Assembly has also called",
      "startMs": "437560",
      "endMs": "442320",
      "startTimeText": "7:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "upon all states to refrain from",
      "startMs": "439760",
      "endMs": "444919",
      "startTimeText": "7:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "promulgating and applying",
      "startMs": "442320",
      "endMs": "447880",
      "startTimeText": "7:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "and to repeal and invalidate laws and",
      "startMs": "444919",
      "endMs": "450240",
      "startTimeText": "7:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "measures that have extraterritorial",
      "startMs": "447880",
      "endMs": "452640",
      "startTimeText": "7:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "effects affecting the sovereignty of",
      "startMs": "450240",
      "endMs": "453840",
      "startTimeText": "7:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "other states",
      "startMs": "452640",
      "endMs": "456080",
      "startTimeText": "7:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "in conformity with their obligations",
      "startMs": "453840",
      "endMs": "457960",
      "startTimeText": "7:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "under the UN Charter and international",
      "startMs": "456080",
      "endMs": "459520",
      "startTimeText": "7:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "law.",
      "startMs": "457960",
      "endMs": "461720",
      "startTimeText": "7:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no doubt that the continued",
      "startMs": "459520",
      "endMs": "463880",
      "startTimeText": "7:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "existence of this embargo in",
      "startMs": "461720",
      "endMs": "465520",
      "startTimeText": "7:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "contravention of the overwhelming",
      "startMs": "463880",
      "endMs": "468240",
      "startTimeText": "7:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "opinion as expressed by this assembly",
      "startMs": "465520",
      "endMs": "470480",
      "startTimeText": "7:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "undermines multilateralism",
      "startMs": "468240",
      "endMs": "472360",
      "startTimeText": "7:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the credibility of the United",
      "startMs": "470480",
      "endMs": "474960",
      "startTimeText": "7:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nations itself.",
      "startMs": "472360",
      "endMs": "476800",
      "startTimeText": "7:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "474960",
      "endMs": "478880",
      "startTimeText": "7:54"
    },
    {
      "text": "as the world's largest democracy with",
      "startMs": "476800",
      "endMs": "481360",
      "startTimeText": "7:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "abiding faith in multilateralism,",
      "startMs": "478880",
      "endMs": "483120",
      "startTimeText": "7:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "India stands in solidarity with this",
      "startMs": "481360",
      "endMs": "486160",
      "startTimeText": "8:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "assembly in its unambiguous rejection of",
      "startMs": "483120",
      "endMs": "488680",
      "startTimeText": "8:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "domestic laws having extraterritorial",
      "startMs": "486160",
      "endMs": "490600",
      "startTimeText": "8:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "impact.",
      "startMs": "488680",
      "endMs": "492720",
      "startTimeText": "8:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "Such embargoes have the effect of",
      "startMs": "490600",
      "endMs": "494600",
      "startTimeText": "8:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "impeding the full achievement of",
      "startMs": "492720",
      "endMs": "497200",
      "startTimeText": "8:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "economic and social development by the",
      "startMs": "494600",
      "endMs": "499760",
      "startTimeText": "8:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "population of the affected country,",
      "startMs": "497200",
      "endMs": "503480",
      "startTimeText": "8:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "in particular, women and children.",
      "startMs": "499760",
      "endMs": "505240",
      "startTimeText": "8:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "They also hinder the full enjoyment of",
      "startMs": "503480",
      "endMs": "507480",
      "startTimeText": "8:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "human rights, including the right to",
      "startMs": "505240",
      "endMs": "510680",
      "startTimeText": "8:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "development, food, medical care, and",
      "startMs": "507480",
      "endMs": "514360",
      "startTimeText": "8:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "social services, among other things.",
      "startMs": "510680",
      "endMs": "516680",
      "startTimeText": "8:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "India has consistently opposed any",
      "startMs": "514360",
      "endMs": "518840",
      "startTimeText": "8:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "unilateral measures by countries that",
      "startMs": "516680",
      "endMs": "520760",
      "startTimeText": "8:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "impinge on the sovereignty of another",
      "startMs": "518840",
      "endMs": "522320",
      "startTimeText": "8:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "country.",
      "startMs": "520760",
      "endMs": "524560",
      "startTimeText": "8:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "As in the 2030 agenda for sustainable",
      "startMs": "522320",
      "endMs": "527000",
      "startTimeText": "8:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "development, the recently adopted pact",
      "startMs": "524560",
      "endMs": "529040",
      "startTimeText": "8:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "for the future has also strongly urged",
      "startMs": "527000",
      "endMs": "531320",
      "startTimeText": "8:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "states to refrain from promulgating and",
      "startMs": "529040",
      "endMs": "533600",
      "startTimeText": "8:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "applying unilateral economic measures",
      "startMs": "531320",
      "endMs": "536640",
      "startTimeText": "8:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "not in accordance with international law",
      "startMs": "533600",
      "endMs": "538720",
      "startTimeText": "8:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the Charter of the United Nations",
      "startMs": "536640",
      "endMs": "540720",
      "startTimeText": "8:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "that impede the full achievement of",
      "startMs": "538720",
      "endMs": "542680",
      "startTimeText": "8:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "economic and social development,",
      "startMs": "540720",
      "endMs": "546280",
      "startTimeText": "9:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "particularly in developing countries.",
      "startMs": "542680",
      "endMs": "548160",
      "startTimeText": "9:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "546280",
      "endMs": "549920",
      "startTimeText": "9:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "successive reports of the Secretary",
      "startMs": "548160",
      "endMs": "552000",
      "startTimeText": "9:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "General have established that the",
      "startMs": "549920",
      "endMs": "554040",
      "startTimeText": "9:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "embargo, particularly through its",
      "startMs": "552000",
      "endMs": "556480",
      "startTimeText": "9:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "extraterritorial effects, has adversely",
      "startMs": "554040",
      "endMs": "558520",
      "startTimeText": "9:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "affected the Cuban people and the",
      "startMs": "556480",
      "endMs": "561040",
      "startTimeText": "9:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "developmental efforts of the country",
      "startMs": "558520",
      "endMs": "563400",
      "startTimeText": "9:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "with particularly devastating effects",
      "startMs": "561040",
      "endMs": "564960",
      "startTimeText": "9:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "owing to shortages of essential",
      "startMs": "563400",
      "endMs": "566880",
      "startTimeText": "9:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "commodities.",
      "startMs": "564960",
      "endMs": "569000",
      "startTimeText": "9:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "The continued embargo would severely",
      "startMs": "566880",
      "endMs": "571400",
      "startTimeText": "9:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "impact Cuba's ability to implement the",
      "startMs": "569000",
      "endMs": "576560",
      "startTimeText": "9:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "2030 agenda in the 6 years that remain.",
      "startMs": "571400",
      "endMs": "576560",
      "startTimeText": "9:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. President,",
      "startMs": "577280",
      "endMs": "581040",
      "startTimeText": "9:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "people-to-people contact holds immense",
      "startMs": "579000",
      "endMs": "582440",
      "startTimeText": "9:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "possibilities",
      "startMs": "581040",
      "endMs": "583960",
      "startTimeText": "9:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "for fostering better understanding",
      "startMs": "582440",
      "endMs": "585360",
      "startTimeText": "9:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "between nations.",
      "startMs": "583960",
      "endMs": "587640",
      "startTimeText": "9:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no doubt that the people of",
      "startMs": "585360",
      "endMs": "590240",
      "startTimeText": "9:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuba can contribute much to the needs of",
      "startMs": "587640",
      "endMs": "592280",
      "startTimeText": "9:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "the global community today. But to",
      "startMs": "590240",
      "endMs": "594560",
      "startTimeText": "9:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "enable this, the international community",
      "startMs": "592280",
      "endMs": "596920",
      "startTimeText": "9:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "needs to intensify its efforts to",
      "startMs": "594560",
      "endMs": "598720",
      "startTimeText": "9:54"
    },
    {
      "text": "promote an environment free from",
      "startMs": "596920",
      "endMs": "601080",
      "startTimeText": "9:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "sanctions and embargoes.",
      "startMs": "598720",
      "endMs": "603160",
      "startTimeText": "9:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "India hopes that the embargo will be",
      "startMs": "601080",
      "endMs": "605320",
      "startTimeText": "10:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "withdrawn at the earliest and supports",
      "startMs": "603160",
      "endMs": "607840",
      "startTimeText": "10:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "the draft resolution moved by Cuba. I",
      "startMs": "605320",
      "endMs": "608840",
      "startTimeText": "10:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "thank you.",
      "startMs": "607840",
      "endMs": "611960",
      "startTimeText": "10:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "Visit our site englishspeechchannel.com",
      "startMs": "608840",
      "endMs": "614120",
      "startTimeText": "10:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "for exclusive access to video",
      "startMs": "611960",
      "endMs": "616920",
      "startTimeText": "10:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "transcripts, offline audio, English",
      "startMs": "614120",
      "endMs": "619600",
      "startTimeText": "10:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "lessons, and private classes.",
      "startMs": "616920",
      "endMs": "621120",
      "startTimeText": "10:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't forget to explore our free and new",
      "startMs": "619600",
      "endMs": "622440",
      "startTimeText": "10:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "ebooks.",
      "startMs": "621120",
      "endMs": "624520",
      "startTimeText": "10:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "Also, subscribe to our weekly newsletter",
      "startMs": "622440",
      "endMs": "626400",
      "startTimeText": "10:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "for the latest updates. Links in the",
      "startMs": "624520",
      "endMs": "628080",
      "startTimeText": "10:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "description below.",
      "startMs": "626400",
      "endMs": "631160",
      "startTimeText": "10:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for your support.",
      "startMs": "628080",
      "endMs": "631160",
      "startTimeText": "10:28"
    }
